                 <div class="title">
                  <!--Override core component to have possibility of empty titles instead of pate title/-->
                  <div id="title-2d16a88e6b" class="cmp-title">
                   <h3 class="cmp-title__text ">BME FX</h3>
                  </div>
                 </div>
                 <div class="text">
                  <div id="text-f0a26b73f5" class="cmp-text ">
                   <p>BME FXS es un servicio de liquidación Pago contra Pago para operaciones en BME FX SPOT y otras plataformas. Es una alternativa a la liquidación bilateral, que reduce el riesgo de liquidación y el uso de líneas de crédito entre contrapartes.</p>
                  </div>
                 </div>
                 <div class="linkslist linkslist--arrow">
                  <div class="linkslist__container">
                   <div data-six-is="linkslist">
                    <ul class="linkslist__list linkslist--vertical">
                     <li class="linkslist__element"><a href="/es/securities-services/fx-services/liquidacion-divisas.html" class="linkslist__link"> <span class="linkslist__link-name">Ir a BME FX</span>
                       <div class="linkslist__arrow-icon">
                        <span class="bme__icon ct-arrow-forward"></span>
                       </div> </a></li>
                    </ul>
                   </div>
                  </div>
                 </div>
                </div>
               </div>
              </div>
              <div class="column--4 counter-2">
               <div class="container__wrapper">
                <div class="container__background" style="background-position-x:;background-position-y:;"></div>
                <div id="container-b8d19f62ee" class="cmp-container  container--align- container-- container--bg-">
                 <div class="image">
                  <div data-cmp-is="image" data-six-is="image" data-cmp-widths="319,510,1024,1920,2560" data-cmp-src="/es/securities-services/_jcr_content/root/containers/container_1131322800/grid_copy_copy/container2/image_copy_copy_copy.coreimg.85{.width}.jpeg/1762317407500/market-insight-web-banner.jpeg" data-cmp-filereference="/content/dam/bme/images/securities-services/market-insight-web-banner.jpg" id="image-124b57cafa" data-cmp-hook-image="imageV3" class="cmp-image" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ImageObject"><img src="/es/securities-services/_jcr_content/root/containers/container_1131322800/grid_copy_copy/container2/image_copy_copy_copy.coreimg.jpeg/1762317407500/market-insight-web-banner.jpeg" srcset="/es/securities-services/_jcr_content/root/containers/container_1131322800/grid_copy_copy/container2/image_copy_copy_copy.coreimg.85.319.jpeg/1762317407500/market-insight-web-banner.jpeg 319w,/es/securities-services/_jcr_content/root/containers/container_1131322800/grid_copy_copy/container2/image_copy_copy_copy.coreimg.85.510.jpeg/1762317407500/market-insight-web-banner.jpeg 510w,/es/securities-services/_jcr_content/root/containers/container_1131322800/grid_copy_copy/container2/image_copy_copy_copy.coreimg.85.1024.jpeg/1762317407500/market-insight-web-banner.jpeg 1024w,/es/securities-services/_jcr_content/root/containers/container_1131322800/grid_copy_copy/container2/image_copy_copy_copy.coreimg.85.1920.jpeg/1762317407500/market-insight-web-banner.jpeg 1920w,/es/securities-services/_jcr_content/root/containers/container_1131322800/grid_copy_copy/container2/image_copy_copy_copy.coreimg.85.2560.jpeg/1762317407500/market-insight-web-banner.jpeg 2560w" loading="lazy" class="cmp-image__image" itemprop="contentUrl" width="814" height="359" alt>
